(()=>{window.NAPOLI_CURATED_ARCHIVE={...(window.NAPOLI_CURATED_ARCHIVE||{}),...{"pio-six-involvements-napoli-six-two-atalanta-2028":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"it","text":"TRE GOL E TRE ASSIST. Sei partecipazioni su sei. Pio è fuori categoria.","replies":[{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"it","text":"Mamma mia che spettacolo!"},{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"10G 8A Napoli after tonight. NT separate."}]},{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"He bullied a defender and fired into the TOP CORNER after eighteen minutes. The rest was inevitable.","replies":[{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"Nothing about the next five goals felt inevitable to us."}]},{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"We came into a title-race game and conceded SIX. No excuses. Pio was disgusting tonight.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Fair play for showing up here after that."}]},{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"At 2-1 I was stressed. At 3-1 I was happy. At 6-1 I forgot how numbers work.","replies":[{"user":"SarriGhost","lang":"en","text":"Then Pašalić hit a huge three."}]},{"user":"ChrisPaulLegacy","lang":"en","text":"MARIO PAŠALIĆ HITS A HUGE THREE TO CUT THE LEAD TO FOUR 💀","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Notably, football goal worth one. But the meme survives."}]},{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"Neves to Pio. Pio to Paz. Pio to Beier. Beier to Pio. Pio to Beier. Beier to Pio. THAT'S THE WHOLE SCORE SHEET.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Print it and put it in the dressing room."}]},{"user":"RomaSud","lang":"en","text":"This doesn't settle the title race. It does mean someone has to actually STOP Napoli.","replies":[{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"en","text":"You'll be hearing from us."}]},{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"Everyone talking about Pio but Paz made that second goal look so simple. Ice cold.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Pio found him. Whole attack is cooking."}]},{"user":"Neves93","lang":"en","text":"Let us remember who supplied the first pass. JOÃO NEVES. Quiet work, huge launch.","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"Then we let the forwards have fun."}]},{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"TWO goals and TWO assists and we are calling him the supporting actor. Absolute cinema.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Only because Pio had 3+3 😭"}]},{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"it","text":"Sul due a uno non ci siamo spaventati. Tre minuti e risposta. Mentalità.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"it","text":"Il terzo al 36' ha cambiato tutto."}]},{"user":"Milanista92","lang":"en","text":"Six goals against Bergamo is not normal. Unfortunately this is Napoli's normal now.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"We're still here."}]},{"user":"MeretUnion","lang":"en","text":"Anyone else mildly irritated we conceded two in a six-goal win? I might be a goalkeeper.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"Keeper Union never takes a night off."}]},{"user":"NicoPazNicoPaz","lang":"es","text":"Nico, qué gol! Pio, qué partido! Una barbaridad.","replies":[{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"Vamos Nico."}]},{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"nap","text":"Guagliù, sei gol a ll'Atalanta! Chist'è 'nu spettacolo!","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"nap","text":"Forza Napule sempe!"}]},{"user":"GoonerNorthBank","lang":"en","text":"Raya still has the only highlight Napoli fans never want to see again.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Let me enjoy one evening without Arsenal please."}]},{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"31 points after 12. 23 scored, 5 conceded. Still no fresh Roma/Atalanta table. Do NOT invent an eight-point gap.","replies":[{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"Thank you. We did play other games."}]},{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"I would like the official transcript of Pio's halftime team talk.","replies":[{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"it","text":"He probably just said 'passami la palla'."}]}],"beier-pio-partnership-four-combinations-atalanta-2028":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"36 PIO→BEIER, 44 BEIER→PIO, 55 PIO→BEIER, 61 BEIER→PIO. Someone frame this.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"They need matching tattoos."}]},{"user":"AzzurriAlSud","lang":"it","text":"Pio torna dalla nazionale con tre gol e poi ne fa tre contro l'Atalanta. Sei nelle ultime tre!","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Three Italy plus three club yes; still two different score books."}]},{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Twelve goals and five assists for Beier this season. People forget he's becoming a superstar too.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"What a beautiful problem to have."}]},{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"The duo gets the posters. Paz deserves a corner on the poster.","replies":[{"user":"Neves93","lang":"en","text":"And João gets a line in the credits."}]},{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"At 55 I knew exactly what was coming. I still couldn't watch.","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"And at 61 it happened again."}]},{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"it","text":"Un attaccante fa il gol, l'altro l'assist. Poi si scambiano. Che intesa!","replies":[{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"it","text":"Due giocatori che pensano come uno."}]},{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"Yes Beier had 2G/2A. Yes Pio 3G/3A. Those are TEN individual goal contributions to SIX team goals. That's not a math error.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Four shared scorer-assist combinations create that effect."}]},{"user":"Milanista92","lang":"en","text":"I spent all week thinking Beier or Pio was more dangerous. The answer is 'yes'.","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"Exactly."}]},{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"One of them scoring doesn't hurt the other. They're literally assisting one another.","replies":[{"user":"RomaSud","lang":"en","text":"Hate admitting that's good team building."}]},{"user":"Neves93","lang":"en","text":"The Neves pass at 18 was the key that unlocked the whole thing.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"And Pio did the hard part against his defender."}]},{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"When does EA invent a combined Player of the Match award?","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"Put both names on one trophy."}]},{"user":"CalcioArchivist","lang":"en","text":"Goal at 44 from Beier, 61 from Beier. Those are TWO Beier assists. Pio has THREE assists to Paz/Beier/Beier.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Correct ledger. Appreciate you."}]},{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"nap","text":"Pio e Beier? Na coppia ca fa paura a tutt'e squadre.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"it","text":"Veramente!"}]},{"user":"GoonerNorthBank","lang":"en","text":"Question: could they do this against Raya?","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"GET OUT OF THE THREAD 😭"}]},{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"No unknown tactical formation needed to explain a beautiful connection. Four passes. Four finishes.","replies":[{"user":"CalcioArchivist","lang":"en","text":"Actual reported match events, thank you."}]},{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"When one was not shooting, he was setting the other up. Nightmare fuel.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"We should put that on a shirt."}]}],"saladino-overrules-bench-pio-hat-trick-atalanta-2028":[{"user":"SaladinoTactics","lang":"en","text":"Assistant: sub Pio. Manager: he's got legs. Six minutes later Pio scores his third. Never doubting Mister again.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"I just heard the assistant coach close his clipboard."}]},{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"it","text":"Il Mister ha detto che Pio e Beier potevano gestire le corse. Al 61' arriva il gol. Perfetto.","replies":[{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"it","text":"Decisione coraggiosa ma ragionata."}]},{"user":"MeretUnion","lang":"en","text":"I approve of resting defenders. I do NOT approve of inventing which defender made a mistake.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"We don't know the actual sub list."}]},{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Imagine taking him off at 55 and missing the hat trick. Not in this timeline.","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"Beier needed his second assist anyway."}]},{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"For the record I would have preferred all eleven Napoli players subbed at 55.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"Respect the honesty."}]},{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"Smart choice to prioritize midfield/defence legs. But did anybody actually come off? No confirmed substitutions yet.","replies":[{"user":"CalcioArchivist","lang":"en","text":"Plan ≠ event. Match archives should stay honest."}]},{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"The real story: everyone alive on the bench could have scored today.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Maybe. But no unconfirmed events please."}]},{"user":"RomaSud","lang":"en","text":"I hope the media asks about managing workloads and not just one scoreline.","replies":[{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"Both questions are reasonable."}]},{"user":"Neves93","lang":"en","text":"I want João protected for the next European match. Can we please have some legs left?","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"No next European fixture date confirmed."}]},{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"Assistant manager prediction market collapsed at 61'.","replies":[{"user":"SaladinoTactics","lang":"en","text":"Mister bought every dip."}]},{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"nap","text":"Chist' allenatore tene 'o curaggio. E Pio tene 'e gol.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"nap","text":"Azz!"}]},{"user":"GoonerNorthBank","lang":"en","text":"Could still have brought Paz off earlier.","replies":[{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"We don't even know who came off. Relax."}]},{"user":"Milanista92","lang":"en","text":"A goal doesn't make every tactical decision right, but wow did it make THIS one feel right.","replies":[{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"Exactly the nuance."}]},{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"We don't have the exact XI or substitutions. Proud the story didn't invent them.","replies":[{"user":"CalcioArchivist","lang":"en","text":"Good journalism even in a fictional football world."}]},{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"I like 'choose your runs'. Much better than exhausting them in a 5-1 match.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"One chosen run gave us the sixth."}]},{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Pio definitely stayed until 61 because he scored at 61. Anything beyond that is unconfirmed.","replies":[{"user":"SaladinoTactics","lang":"en","text":"Ledger first."}]}],"napoli-31-points-atalanta-pasalic-brace-2028":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"League row: 12 played, 10W 1D 1L, 31 points, 23 for, 5 against, +18. Screenshot the Napoli row, not the rivals.","replies":[{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"Official."}]},{"user":"MeretUnion","lang":"en","text":"Only THREE conceded in eleven games, then TWO today. Happy about six goals but study both conceded.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Fair. Wins don't erase work."}]},{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"Mario Pašalić scored twice and we lost 6-2. That is a deeply unfortunate player-of-the-match campaign.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"Chris Paul approves."}]},{"user":"ChrisPaulLegacy","lang":"en","text":"89' PAŠALIĆ FINDS A HUGE GOAL TO CUT THE LEAD TO FOUR","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"BANG! The gap is only four!"}]},{"user":"RomaSud","lang":"en","text":"Please update the real table before claiming you are eight clear of Atalanta. The old screenshot had fewer matchdays.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Exactly.'"}]},{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"it","text":"Sei gol fatti, due subiti. In attacco fantastici, ma la difesa deve ascoltare la lezione.","replies":[{"user":"MeretUnion","lang":"it","text":"La pensiamo uguale."}]},{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Scudetto statement sent. Europe still needs attention after Arsenal.","replies":[{"user":"GoonerNorthBank","lang":"en","text":"We appreciate this reminder."}]},{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"nap","text":"Trentuno punti e nun avimmo ancora finito. Forza Napule!","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"it","text":"Sempre!"}]},{"user":"CalcioArchivist","lang":"en","text":"João Neves gets his first verified assist of this current campaign vs Atalanta. Do not leave it off the stat board.","replies":[{"user":"Neves93","lang":"en","text":"YES."}]},{"user":"Milanista92","lang":"en","text":"The strangest thing is we can admit a defensive warning when you scored six.","replies":[{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"Winning 6-2 is not winning 6-0."}]},{"user":"AtalantaAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"Our last verified table number was 20 after nine. Other matches happened after. We don't know exact post-game points.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Thank you."}]},{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"From Jankowski saving everything to six goals against Atalanta. Football is a psychiatric experiment.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"That's why we're here."}]},{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"The penalty save was Donnarumma for ITALY, not Napoli today. I have already seen people mix it up.","replies":[{"user":"CalcioArchivist","lang":"en","text":"Separate national and club ledgers."}]},{"user":"BergamoCurva","lang":"en","text":"You can't fault Pašalić for trying. But the 89th was... cosmetic.","replies":[{"user":"ChrisPaulLegacy","lang":"en","text":"COSMETIC?! Huge three, mate."}]},{"user":"Neves93","lang":"en","text":"The assist matters as much as the goal. We won because multiple lines connected.","replies":[{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"Nico too."}]},{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"31 points in 12. That is the figure nobody else can dispute.","replies":[{"user":"RomaSud","lang":"en","text":"Not disputing that one."}]}]}};})();
